              "content": "· 无额度能力的连接不生成百分比进度条；无重置时间的窗口倒计时位置显示「—」。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "I8cCrs",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 未连接状态不画成 0%，与真实零用量、查询失败分开表达。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YXa3b",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 三种变体共用同一 UsageIsland 组件与右侧 112px 增量预留区，宽度不随内容变化。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "R0wVkq",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 额度水位阈值按「已用百分比」判定：< 75% 绿（$success）、75–89% 琥珀（$warn）、≥ 90% 红（$danger）。阈值对 5h 与 7d 等所有额度窗口一致，不因窗口长短改变。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "AkRjW",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 着色只作用于进度条填充；轨道、周期标签（5h 淡紫 / 7d 淡绿）与百分比文字颜色不变，标签保持窗口身份而不表示水位。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "FUKoA",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 查询失败、未连接、接口不支持时不着色也不画进度条，与「真实已用 100%」分开表达，不能把失败画成满格红条。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
