            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jNmTV",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 七列固定：时间 / 计费模型 / 输入 / 输出 / 总成本 / 用时·首字 / 状态；不新增「供应商」「来源」列，也不自动加入缓存 R/W 明细。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "siykS",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 基准表格宽度 1064px，列宽 128 / 344 / 108 / 108 / 128 / 144 / 104（含单元格内边距）；宽屏多出的空间优先给计费模型列，窄窗口在表格内横向滚动、不隐藏列。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ijfu2",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 本地日志没有 HTTP 响应码时显示真实「成功」状态，不自动补 200；缺失的输入 / 输出 / 成本 / 耗时显示「—」。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c62lZj",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 成本为估算值时必须标识「估算」，不能当作实际账单金额；非零微小金额可显示 <$0.0001，不得显示成 0。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "H0rFO",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 主面板「当前查看平台」与「灵动岛显示平台」相互独立：在此浏览其他平台不会回写灵动岛配置。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LLZGD",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 计费模型与套餐名过长时单行省略并以「…」结尾，悬停或键盘聚焦查看完整名称；输入 / 输出 / 成本等数值不省略，始终用等宽数字与紧凑单位完整显示。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "X6ffY",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 请求日志默认每页 10 条——该文案不在界面上显示；左侧只显示当前筛选范围内的总条数，右侧为页码按钮加页码输入与「跳转」。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YK8wn",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 页码按钮最多占 7 个位置，超出用不可点击的「…」省略：靠前 1 2 3 4 5 … N，靠后 1 … N-4 N-3 N-2 N-1 N，居中 1 … c-1 c c+1 … N；总页数不超过 7 时全部列出。总条数不可得时显示「共 — 条记录」并降级为上一页 / 下一页，不编造页数。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
