          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "S7F1Q",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 只有接口明确提供 Key 独立余额时才标注「当前 Key 余额」；否则标注「账户共享余额」并说明归属。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vRe8i",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 预算剩余额度、套餐点数与已产生费用不冒充现金余额。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "GoUM2",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 普通调用 Key、管理凭证与余额查询权限是不同能力；如需额外查询凭证，在设置中说明用途与权限。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "IjECC",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· API 连接的 Token 汇总、趋势图与七列日志与官方账号完全一致，仅顶部区域不同。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jm5rC",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 请求日志默认每页 10 条——该文案不在界面上显示；左侧只显示当前筛选范围内的总条数，右侧为页码按钮加页码输入与「跳转」。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "dgYwb",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 页码按钮最多占 7 个位置，超出用不可点击的「…」省略：靠前 1 2 3 4 5 … N，靠后 1 … N-4 N-3 N-2 N-1 N，居中 1 … c-1 c c+1 … N；总页数不超过 7 时全部列出。总条数不可得时显示「共 — 条记录」并降级为上一页 / 下一页，不编造页数。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "SDGLK",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 余额数值按水位着色：充足绿、偏低琥珀、耗尽红、不可用灰。绿色用可读性更高的 $success-text（浅 #06834A / 深 #3ADB8B），不用进度条的 #06C167，保证 32px 数字在白底上的对比度。告警阈值待确认，阈值未定前不得声称某个余额「充足」。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
