                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "EUtlt",
                          "name": "Label",
                          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "勾选后结束时间输入禁用，每次查询或刷新使用当时的当前时间作为结束点；同一次图表与日志查询使用同一个结束时间快照。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                          "fontSize": 11,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "okkm6",
          "name": "Annotations",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ox8Bc",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 点击开始或结束时间区域后，右侧日历编辑该端点并支持前后翻月；当前编辑区域使用高亮边框。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "GOFBa",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 「确定」校验通过后应用范围并查询当前平台数据，趋势图与请求日志同步更新并回到第一页；「取消」保留之前生效的查询范围。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aXsD5",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 打开弹窗不立即改变已生效的筛选；提交后高亮「自定义时间」并显示实际起止范围摘要。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s1nMhN",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 快捷范围复用已确认的今日 / 本周 / 本月 / 累计；不新增 1d / 7d / 14d / 30d，「本周」与「最近 7 天」不混用。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "N74S7e",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 蓝色仅用于该筛选控件的选中态与确定按钮，不替换绿色额度进度条。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
