            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yYlSj",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 所有数字使用等宽数字避免刷新抖动；金额仅适度强调，不让每列都加粗。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DnvqU",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 筛选变化（平台 / 周期 / 自定义范围）回到第一页，普通刷新保持浏览位置与滚动位置。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "gSiJl",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 表格与趋势图区块间距约 24px；区块标题为「请求日志」，紧邻显示当前平台名称。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LcS2j",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 请求日志默认每页 10 条——该文案不在界面上显示；左侧只显示当前筛选范围内的总条数，右侧为页码按钮加页码输入与「跳转」。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "gqd7i",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 页码按钮最多占 7 个位置，超出用不可点击的「…」省略：靠前 1 2 3 4 5 … N，靠后 1 … N-4 N-3 N-2 N-1 N，居中 1 … c-1 c c+1 … N；总页数不超过 7 时全部列出。总条数不可得时显示「共 — 条记录」并降级为上一页 / 下一页，不编造页数。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
