              "id": "P0ZstI",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 更新失败但有历史值时保留最后值并标明过期与更新时间，灵动岛保留旧值并显示轻量过期标记。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "e3ja9",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 状态不只依赖颜色区分，同时提供图标与文字。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "k8iZL",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 界面上不承诺具体内存数值，也不增加常驻性能监控控件。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YGeHP",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 额度水位阈值：已用 < 75% 绿、75–89% 琥珀、≥ 90% 红，对所有额度窗口一致。选 75% 是「还剩四分之一」的自然分界，选 90% 是「一两次长会话就会用完」的临界点；中间保留 15 个百分点缓冲，避免告警一闪而过造成脱敏。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Jjo7p",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 颜色是冗余编码而非唯一通道：进度条长度与已用百分比数字始终可读，主面板宽行另给「正常 / 接近上限 / 已耗尽」等级文字。倒计时到零显示「等待更新」，不把已用额度清零。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
