              "id": "Du1IY",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "主面板左上角标题栏：16px 单条简化版 + 产品名「CC Usage」。系统托盘、任务栏与安装包使用同一套图标，应用图标不随浅深主题变化——始终白底，这是桌面应用的通行做法。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "VwOTI",
          "name": "Annotations",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "JDLly",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 造型语言：白色圆角方底（圆角 = 边长 22%）+ 居中单一标记，对齐 Claude Code / cc-switch 那类桌面图标的范式；标记内容完全用本产品自己的元素，不含任何第三方品牌图形。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "u7K51",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 标记 = 深色灵动岛胶囊 + 岛内两条绿色额度条（长短不同，对应 5h / 7d），直接映射产品第一屏。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kncxC",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 尺寸分级：≥ 64px 用双条 + 轨道；32 / 24px 去掉轨道保留双条；16px 只保留一条加粗横条，避免糊成一团。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "P4Cw1",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 导出：ICO 打包 16 / 24 / 32 / 48 / 64 / 128 / 256；Tauri 另需 PNG 32 / 128 / 128@2x 与 icon.icns、icon.ico。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mOw3Z",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 仓库名 cc-usage，产品名 CC Usage，两者一致，不再使用 AI Usage Monitor。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
