        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "i9S0y",
          "name": "Annotations",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "O3B4ha",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "托盘左键打开主面板；右键菜单与灵动岛右键共用。开关只用勾选表示，悬停为中性灰，键盘焦点清晰可见。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qdiJt",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 托盘 tooltip 显示当前灵动岛配置的平台、连接与各额度窗口的已用百分比，以及最近更新时间；数据不可得的项显示「—」，不留空。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mUh19",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 水位角标取当前配置下最紧张的那个额度窗口，阈值沿用第 3 节：< 75% 绿、75–89% 琥珀、≥ 90% 红。未连接 / 查询失败 / 来源不可用显示中性灰，不画成红色。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ptLZw",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 「立即刷新」手动触发一次额度与余额查询，仍遵守平台频率限制；触发后该项禁用并显示「刷新中…」，失败时按既有失败态提示，不清空已有数值。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "D7nAYQ",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 「免打扰」只暂停 Token 增量提示、水位变色提醒与通知，**不停止采集与统计**；开启状态需持久化，并在设置的悬浮窗选项中同步可见。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "X4O4J",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 「重置窗口位置」把灵动岛拉回主显示器中央、解除停靠，并把主面板恢复默认尺寸与位置。它只动窗口几何，不改平台 / 连接 / 来源 / 查询范围等任何配置。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "h2uRWP",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 切换连接提供 Claude Auth / API Key、Codex Auth / API Key；未配置项禁用。显示位置提供自由悬浮与四边居中。子页保留返回入口，同一窗口内展示以避免屏幕边缘裁切。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZaRLN",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 灵动岛展开态右上角为「切换连接」；托盘与右键菜单「打开主面板」定位当前连接。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mYHH8",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 菜单项高度 32px、圆角 6px、左侧 16px 图标位、分隔线上下留 4px；宽度 268px，子菜单 300px。禁用项降低不透明度而非隐藏。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
