              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 连接已过期时「获取」排在「重新授权」前面：用户若刚在 CLI 里重新登录过，直接重读本地凭证即可，无需再走一遍浏览器授权。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "MaftI",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 获取失败不得清空或破坏现有连接，也不得把连接标记为已移除；保留原状态并就近提示。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "AUSR8",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 凭证读取范围需在界面上说明（扫描了哪些路径与环境变量），不静默读取用户未预期的位置。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "b6U3R4",
          "name": "Annotations",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "TEEgc",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 两个入口：连接表每行内的「获取」（重读本机凭证），以及区块标题右侧的「+ 添加连接」（建立新连接）。空状态时表体中央给「添加第一个连接」。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "buVNJ",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 接入方式只有官方订阅（Auth）与 API Key 两种。本地会话记录是「统计来源」而非连接，不出现在连接表与添加流程中。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KAT4j",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 同一平台下两种接入方式可以并存，也可以有多个 API Key；连接名称由用户填写，用于在灵动岛与主面板中区分。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "w0n2ob",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 移除只断开连接、删除凭证与配置，**不删历史统计数据**；要删数据走「数据 → 历史清理」，避免一个按钮承担两种不可撤销后果。重新添加同一账号时历史能接上。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "RC84z",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 被移除的连接如果正是灵动岛当前配置，确认框必须提前给出橙色警示；移除后灵动岛进入无可显示连接状态，**不自动换成其他账号**（与 7.3 一致）。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jLftt",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· API Key 验证失败、授权被拒绝或超时，停留在当前步骤并就近提示，不关闭弹窗、不留下半成品连接。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HmILU",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 凭证只保存在本机，界面与日志始终只显示脱敏标识；软件不接触账号密码，只保存授权返回的凭证。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lTPDz",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 授权流程按各平台实际支持方式适配，稿中的「浏览器授权」为通用示意，具体能力待接入前验证。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
