        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "mGXrX",
          "name": "E · 推荐与落地",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aW0VD",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "E · 小的的推荐：B3 · 绿岛",
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mYGNU",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 选 B3 的理由：四种桌面背景全部成立，且是唯一一个「主体形状 = 一座发亮的岛」的方案，和 CC Usage 这个名字直接对上；绿色只占岛本身约 33%，界面里「绿 = 额度健康」的语义不会被图标用满而稀释。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "F3GcG",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· B2 绿底识别距离最远，如果鼠鼠更看重任务栏里的一眼可辨，选它；代价是品牌绿在图标上用满后，额度进度条的绿就不再是产品里唯一的强调色。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "nNjWb",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· B1 只是把白底换成石墨灰，风险最低，但在深色桌面上底板会和背景融在一起，是三个里最弱的一个，列在这里主要作为保守退路。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fLvHK",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 尺寸分级沿用原稿已确认的规则：≥ 64px 双条 + 轨道；32 / 24px 去掉轨道保留双条；16px 只留一条加粗横条。三个提案的梯队都按这个规则画了。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jMPUX",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 未定：圆角仍取边长 22%（Windows 11 任务栏图标的常见值）。是否改用 Squircle 曲率、是否给底板加极轻的对角渐变，待鼠鼠确认后再调。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YCAGw",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 定稿后需要替换的文件：backend/icons/ 下的 32x32.png、128x128.png、128x128@2x.png、icon.png、icon.ico，以及 frontend/public/favicon.svg 和 C/AppIcon 组件（Mnpeo）。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
