            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mRUyb",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "C · 主面板场景下的结论",
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "y1vzi",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 原稿 A 在这里暴露得最清楚：浅色标题栏 #F7F7F8 上，白色底板几乎和标题栏融成一片，只剩一个黑色胶囊孤零零浮着，图标失去了「一块完整图形」的存在感；换到深色标题栏 #1F1F1F 上又变成一块突兀的白方块，两头都不讨好。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "M9VRdu",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· B3 在浅色标题栏上是一块明确的深色图形，轻重和产品名的 #111111 文字相称；在深色标题栏上底板自然融进背景，只剩绿岛浮出来，读起来像一个绿色标记——这个「融底留绿」的效果是加分项，不是缺陷。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "v8stBX",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· B2 绿底在两种标题栏上都很跳。标题栏里图标只占 16px，旁边就是产品名，绿色饱和度这么高会把视线从内容上拽走；它更适合任务栏和桌面，不适合常驻在标题栏。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "RwDlU",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· B1 在深色标题栏上石墨灰和 #1F1F1F 太接近，边界要靠 #FFFFFF1A 的内高光撑，1:1 尺寸下这条高光基本看不见，实际会糊。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sxNAV",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 需要注意：主面板窗口用的是 16px 单条简化版（16px 只留一条加粗横条），这是原稿已确认的分级规则，本提案没有改。上面 B 区两个完整窗口的标题栏已经换成 B3，其余内容原样复制自 08 号画板，未作任何改动。",
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
