            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "o89N8K",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 绿色按钮只在「有新版本」时渲染在标题栏应用名右侧（24×24 圆形，success-soft 底 + circle-arrow-up）；无更新时完全隐藏，不占位。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lDoVF",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 点击绿色按钮 = 直接进入安装：立即开始分块下载并弹出进度对话框，无二次确认（鼠鼠指定）；「忽略此版本」是按钮悬停提示里的次级操作，写入本地后同版本不再提示。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "M7VhiA",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 下载 → 校验签名（Tauri updater 公钥内置，私钥随 GitHub Release 发布签名）→ Windows 先清理托盘图标与单实例锁再替换安装（插件会硬退出进程）→ 完成后可「立即重启」或「稍后」。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t6ahI",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 更新期间用量采集、本地代理与灵动岛不受影响；下载中对话框不可关闭，标题栏按钮同步转为旋转 / 对勾态。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Hn0LF",
              "name": "Note",
              "fill": "$text-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 辅助入口：设置 · 常规 · 关于，显示当前版本与检查时间；发现新版后按钮转绿，行为与标题栏按钮一致。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
