              "content": "· 发布流程：pnpm tauri signer 生成密钥对 → 构建时私钥签名 NSIS 安装包 → Release 附 latest.json（版本、下载地址、签名）→ 应用端 endpoint 指向该 Release。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
