        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "y84DW",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 手动填写仅适用于 API Key 类型；官方订阅（Auth）仍只能从本机 CLI 读取，不开放手动凭证。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "D1GLZ",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 「获取模型」= 后端新命令 fetch_remote_models(base_url, api_key)：GET {base_url}/v1/models，Claude 走 x-api-key + anthropic-version 头，OpenAI 兼容网关走 Authorization Bearer；超时 10s。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fOUq2",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 拉取失败不阻塞添加：模型可留空、可手动输入任意名称（自建网关的模型往往不在公开列表）。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "B2oVgy",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 新增后端命令 add_manual_connection：先验证（用 Key 请求一次 models 或 messages 端点）再入库；Key 只存本机，界面只显示脱敏标识，规则与现有 API 连接一致。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VeZwR",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 思考强度（关闭/低/中/高）与 1M 上下文作为该连接的默认参数随连接保存；1M 开关仅 Claude 平台显示，开启后成本估算按 1M 档价目计算（pricing.rs 需加 1M 价目）。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VBWrE",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 数据库连接表加三列：model / effort / context_1m（可空），历史连接为 NULL 不受影响；请求日志继续记录实际发生的 effort。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UVvaP",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 两个获取按钮在请求期间文案变为「正在获取」并禁用，完成后恢复「获取模型」/「获取强度」；按钮各自独立，可分别重试。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
